ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.655Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="# Sidebar Audit — opencode-deepseek-jev"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.676Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.703Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="Audit date: 2026-09-23 (UTC). Scope: `/workspace` (repo) and `/notes` (chat logs)."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.729Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="This report was produced by the packaged coding agent as requested by"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.753Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`scripts/archive/one-shot/run-audit-via-agent.sh`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.777Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.798Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="## 1. Project identity"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.822Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.848Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="This repo is a Docker-packaged coding-agent environment that wraps the OpenCode"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.873Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="binary around a DeepSeek 'V4.1 Flash' provider and the Jev review/guard tooling."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.895Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`README.txt` describes a self-contained setup whose prerequisites are Docker, an"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.921Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="authenticated `gh`, a DeepSeek key (`sk-`), and a Jev key (`apikey_`), with keys"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.947Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="cached in a mode-0600 gitignored `.env.local`. `QUICKSTART.txt` points operators at"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.971Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="the Dockge management UI (port 5001) and states that the image built from `docker/`"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:39.996Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="embeds the OpenCode binary, the DeepSeek provider config, the `jev-guard` plugin,"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.022Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="and the `jev-review` MCP server. `opencode.json` confirms this: provider"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.044Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`deepseek`/model `deepseek-flash`, `plugin: ['jev-guard']`, skills under"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.066Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`/opt/jev-review/skills`, and an MCP server `jev-review` launched via"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.089Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`node /opt/jev-review/dist/server.js`. In short, it is an opinionated, script-driven"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.114Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="container image for running an OpenCode + DeepSeek agent with Jev feedback."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.139Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.160Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="## 2. Rule system"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.182Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.208Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`/notes` is **not visible** in this environment (`stat /notes` -> no such file or"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.230Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="directory; no `notes/` directory exists under `/workspace`). It therefore could not"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.258Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="be grepped for the requested rule patterns, and no rule numbers were extracted from"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.282Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="the chat logs."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.309Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.336Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="Cross-reference performed against the cited set in `push_notes_v18.sh`. The path"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.360Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="named in the audit brief, `scripts/archive/one-shot/push_notes_v18.sh`, **does not"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.382Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="exist**; the file is actually at the repo root: `/workspace/push_notes_v18.sh`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.405Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.428Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="Rules cited by `push_notes_v18.sh` (header lines 12-16, plus inline Rule #28):"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.449Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.474Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| Rule | Cited meaning in the script |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.496Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| ---- | --------------------------- |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.517Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #7   | no sed / guarded |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.540Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #8   | no `2>/dev/null` |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.561Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #28  | dependency check |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.583Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #34  | push-evidence (with #47) |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.609Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #37  | SKIP != PASS |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.634Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #38  | printf |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.657Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #39  | gitignore-checked before add (with #45) |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.681Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #41  | UTC timestamps |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.703Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #45  | gitignore-checked before add (with #39) |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.723Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #47  | push-evidence (with #34) |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.746Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #53  | owner/repo via python3, never sed |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.771Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #54  | evidence completeness gate |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.793Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #55  | raw-link HTTP-200 validation with backoff |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.823Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="| #57  | end sentinel |"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.853Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.880Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Cited but undefined:** all fourteen rules above (#7, #8, #28, #34, #37, #38,"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.910Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  #39, #41, #45, #47, #53, #54, #55, #57). A repository-wide search for rule"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.939Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  definitions (`Rule #`, `#7`-style anchors) in `/workspace` returned nothing: the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.972Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  definitions evidently live only in `/notes`, which is inaccessible here."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:40.999Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Defined but uncited:** none observed, because no definitions are present in the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.024Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  accessible corpus. The script also references a `LOGGING CONVENTION` that has no"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.053Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  definition in `/workspace`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.078Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.105Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="## 3. JEV"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.144Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.166Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`/notes` could not be grepped (not visible). In `/workspace`, case-insensitive"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.190Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="matches for `jev` are widespread:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.213Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.247Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `opencode.json`: `plugin: ['jev-guard']`, `skills: ['/opt/jev-review/skills']`,"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.273Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  and MCP server `jev-review` (`node /opt/jev-review/dist/server.js`,"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.296Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `JEV_API_KEY` env)."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.319Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `QUICKSTART.txt`: names the `jev-guard` plugin and `jev-review` MCP server."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.355Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `README.txt`: title and prerequisites (`Jev API key`, console.typesafe.ai)."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.379Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `docker/Dockerfile`: `opencode plugin jev-guard@0.3.1 --global` and"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.405Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `git clone https://github.com/NiazMorshed2007/jev-review.git /opt/jev-review`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.433Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `docker/docker-compose.yml`, `docker/run.sh`, `docker/build.sh`,"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.459Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `scripts/ask.sh`, `scripts/doctor.sh`: image/container name"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.485Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `opencode-deepseek-jev:robust`; `doctor.sh` probes `model:'jev-latest'` and checks"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.510Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  the plugin list for `jev-guard`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.534Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- `scripts/test-repo.sh`: gates G3/G4 for `jev-review` and the `jev-guard` install"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.559Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  line; accepts `apikey_`, `sk-`, `ts_`, `jev-` key prefixes."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.586Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- Numerous `.bak.*` snapshots and `scripts/archive/...` copies repeat the same"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.613Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  strings. `/opt/jev-review` itself is outside the repo and was not inspected."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.637Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:41.662Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="## 4. Current state"
