ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.114Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - ../data/opencode:/home/node/.local/share/opencode"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.137Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    env_file:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.165Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - ../.env.local"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.188Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    environment:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.215Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      OPENCODE_DISABLE_DEFAULT_PLUGINS: 'true'"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.245Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    restart: unless-stopped"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.272Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    security_opt:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.299Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - no-new-privileges:true"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.325Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    cap_drop:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.349Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - ALL"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.377Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="    cap_add:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.406Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - CHOWN"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.428Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - SETUID"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.456Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="      - SETGID"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.484Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="```"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.508Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.534Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`docker/web-entrypoint.sh`: a POSIX `sh` entrypoint with `set -u`. It resolves"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.558Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`DATA_DIR='${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/opencode'`, `mkdir -p`s it, and if"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.580Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` is non-empty writes `auth.json`"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.607Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="(`{ deepseek: { type: 'api', key: <key> } }`) using an inline `node -e` script"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.635Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="(JSON-safe serialisation, no sed/escaping), logging the byte size to stderr. If the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.658Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="key is empty it prints a warning and writes nothing. It then"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.684Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="`exec opencode web --hostname 0.0.0.0 --port 4096`."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.709Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.732Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="Session count: `sqlite3` is **not installed** in this environment, so the requested"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.759Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="command could not run. The equivalent query via Node's built-in SQLite"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.785Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="(`node --experimental-sqlite`) against `/workspace/data/opencode/opencode.db`"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.812Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="returned:"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.833Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.858Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="```"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.887Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="session count: 8"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.911Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="```"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.930Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.953Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="The web service block does **not** mount `/notes`; only the `opencode` (TUI) service"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:42.982Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="has `- ../notes:/notes:ro` (line 31)."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.005Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.030Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="## 5. Open risks"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.054Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text=""
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.080Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **The agent cannot read `/notes`.** The `../notes:/notes:ro` bind mount exists on"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.105Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  the `opencode` (TUI) service but not on `opencode-web`, which is the service the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.128Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  audit/agent runs in. Worse, `run-audit-via-agent.sh`'s `ensure_notes_mount` guard"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.166Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  greps the *whole* compose file for `/notes`, so it sees the TUI line, concludes the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.197Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  mount is 'already present', and never adds it to `opencode-web`. Any workflow that"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.226Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  assumes chat-log access (chatlog.sh, rule extraction) silently degrades."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.251Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Secrets on disk.** `.env.local` and two timestamped `.env.local.bak.*` files hold"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.277Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  live DeepSeek/JEV keys (mode 0600, gitignored, but the backups are untracked"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.303Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  leftovers). Rotation scripts (`rotate-keys-guided.sh`, `rotate-api-keys.sh`) mutate"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.326Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  these, so a half-run rotation can leave stale/duplicate credentials."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.351Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Broken references and missing tooling.** The audit brief's"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.376Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `scripts/archive/one-shot/push_notes_v18.sh` does not exist (real file at repo"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.401Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  root), and neither `sqlite3` nor `python3` is on PATH even though"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.425Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `push_notes_v18.sh`, `run-audit-via-agent.sh`, `rotate-keys-guided.sh`, and"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.451Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  `test-repo.sh` depend on them."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.470Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Uncommitted drift.** `git status` shows many modified tracked files plus dozens of"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.493Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  untracked `*.bak.*` snapshots; the SQLite DB carries a ~1.2 MB WAL. The repo is in a"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.518Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  mid-migration state, so 'current' behavior may not match HEAD."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.542Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="- **Network/auth exposure.** `opencode-web` publishes `0.0.0.0:4096` and, per the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.567Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  compose comment, has no authentication when `OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD` is unset;"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.589Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  combined with the whole-repo `/workspace` bind and host-UID passthrough, exposing the"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.614Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="  port to an untrusted network grants full agent/repo access."
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.636Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="[0m"
ts=2026-09-23T17:53:43.664Z level=INFO phase=agent stage=live status=LINE text="[0m$ [0mls -la /workspace/docker"
